pp_v1_03_vigenere_known_key.description:
The ciphertext below was produced with a repeating-key Vigenere cipher over ASCII letters. Non-letter characters were copied unchanged, and the key advances only on letters. The key is the uppercase word `SECAUTOMIND` and it restarts from the first letter for every new message.

ciphertext = xpcg{v6v37rp96k79}

Decrypt it to obtain the flag (the plaintext already is in flag{...} form).
